version: 2.0.0
components:
  TasksSection:
    description: Tasks section shell in Platform UI — header band (title + live "{n} open · {n} in-flight" stat) and a Board|List|Inbox ViewSwitcher. Defaults to List; Board/Inbox render "coming next" placeholders this round. 10s section-guarded poll for fetchTasks.
    type: view
    tags: [feature, tasks, platform]
  ListView:
    description: Priority-ranked vertical list of TaskCards (high → low) sourced from tasksStore. Handles loading/error/empty states.
    type: view
    tags: [feature, tasks, platform]
  TaskCard:
    description: Card cloning the lore-card structure — priority + status chips, line-clamped title, the prominent CalibrationBlock, a claimant chip colored via the shared AGENT_COLORS map, a fragile/symbol tag row, and a GitHub badge when external_ref.provider is github.
    type: component
    tags: [feature, tasks, platform]
  CalibrationBlock:
    description: The calibration moat made visible. Largest non-title element on every card — big Fibonacci story-point number with a green LEARNED badge (◆ + n{count}) for learned estimates, or a dimmed italic ~prior~ label for cold-start guesses, plus the raw token band. Learned vs prior contrast is the headline.
    type: component
    tags: [feature, tasks, platform, moat]
  tasksStore:
    description: Zustand store mirroring loreStore's idiom — state {tasks, loading, error, view}, fetchTasks() reads GET /api/tasks?status=active&limit=100 with an AbortController per fetch, setView(). Board/Inbox fetches are stubs this round.
    type: state
    tags: [feature, tasks, platform, state]
  storyPoints:
    description: Pure helper tokenBandToPoints({min,max}) → Fibonacci story point (1/2/3/5/8/13/21) by mapping the band midpoint through tunable token thresholds (POINT_THRESHOLDS), to be re-fit against real actuals later.
    type: util
    tags: [feature, tasks, platform, calibration]
